{"id":309,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"創発学と国際理解で伸びる明大世田谷","feature_description":"明大付属世田谷は、教育理念を土台に、国際理解教育、理数教育、キャリア教育、創発学を組み合わせた学びを進める学校です。学校生活や部活動も含めて、生徒の学びが社会との接点を持ちやすい構成です。大学附属校としての進路の見通しも持ちやすいです。 公式サイトの学校生活や行事の導線も整っており、比較用に必要な情報を確認しやすいです。入学後の姿も想像しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5911,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5912,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5913,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5914,"name":"社会科研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5915,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5916,"name":"囲碁・将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5917,"name":"為替株式学習部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5918,"name":"サイエンスプロジェクト同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5919,"name":"フットサル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5920,"name":"トライアスロン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5921,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.nihongakuen.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5922,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://meijisetagaya.n